# Exceptions for tools/check-style.sh, one per line: <rule> <path pattern> <reason>
# Rules: ascii, dash, german. The pattern is a shell pattern, * also matches across /.

# Rebuilding these costs hours (toolchain image, deps, WebKit); translated with the next real update
german toolchain/Dockerfile comments change the toolchain image tag
german toolchain/*.cpp      comments change the toolchain image tag
german engine/patches/*     comments change WebKit sources

